{"id":"n83367-1-8","stage":5,"title":"포부 · 抱负","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83367-1-8-1","ko":"우리 회사에 입사한 뒤의 포부는 무엇입니까?","zh":"您加入我们公司后有什么规划吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"회사에","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사에","audio":"/audio/b40802e07b0e88855c61.mp3"}},{"text":"입사한","meaning":"入职，进公司","explanation":"입사하다：入职，进公司；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"입사하다","audio":"/audio/3ccb2efa4f70be7246ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24622","senseId":"1","lemma":"입사하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입사한","audio":"/audio/5efc267f5863709f1ad3.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤의","meaning":"背后，背地里，内幕","explanation":"뒤：背后，背地里，内幕；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"3","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤의","audio":"/audio/bab54b2056d9cff7c377.mp3"}},{"text":"포부는","meaning":"抱负，志向，理想","explanation":"포부：抱负，志向，理想；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"포부","audio":"/audio/ce99b7e8a932c87bc328.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83367","senseId":"1","lemma":"포부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"포부는","audio":"/audio/7b5228e655b97550310f.mp3"}},{"text":"무엇입니까?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무엇입니까","audio":"/audio/c5857f5c5455b475904e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"3ccb2efa4f70be72","term":"입사하다","zh":"入职，进公司","audio":"/audio/3ccb2efa4f70be7246ce.mp3","entryId":"24622","definition":"在公司等中获得职位，进入公司。","pronunciation":["입싸하다"]},{"id":"c65326b2de936236","term":"뒤","zh":"背后，背地里，内幕","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3","entryId":"67477","definition":"不显露于外的部分。","pronunciation":["뒤ː"]},{"id":"ce99b7e8a932c87b","term":"포부","zh":"抱负，志向，理想","audio":"/audio/ce99b7e8a932c87bc328.mp3","entryId":"83367","definition":"心中怀有的对未来的计划或希望。","pronunciation":["포ː부"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]}],"audio":"/audio/aebc034d549b56758834.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83367-1-8-2","ko":"이십 년 안에 회사 최초의 여성 사장이 되는 것입니다.","zh":"在二十年内成为公司首位女性社长。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이십","meaning":"二十","explanation":"이십：二十。","readings":[{"term":"이십","audio":"/audio/b97d27f097a8b4a033bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31648","senseId":"1","lemma":"이십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이십","audio":"/audio/b97d27f097a8b4a033bb.mp3"}},{"text":"년","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年。","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}},{"text":"안에","meaning